TERM alacritty*
TERM ansi
TERM *color*
TERM con[0-9]*x[0-9]*
TERM cons25
TERM console
TERM cygwin
TERM *direct*
TERM dtterm
TERM foot
TERM gnome
TERM hurd
TERM jfbterm
TERM konsole
TERM kterm
TERM linux
